<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/icon.svg">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/icon.svg">

    <!-- google font: montserrat -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
    html {
        font-size: 13px;
    }

    button, input, select, option, textarea {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
    }

    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        background-color: #e4e5e7;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 0px;
        color: #1f2933;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    ::selection {
        background-color: #0b3866;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    ::-moz-selection {
        background-color: #0b3866;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        width: 100%;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: hsl(0, 0%, 100%);
        padding: 15px;
        flex: 1 0 auto;
    }

    footer {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        width: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(60deg, #0b3866 0%, #28517a 100%);
        border-top: 4px solid rgb(236, 154, 0);
        color: #e5e7eb;
        padding: 30px max(30px, calc((100% - 1200px) / 2)) 20px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    footer a {
        color: #e5e7eb;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: color 0.25s ease;
    }

    footer a:hover {
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .footer-content {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 30px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        padding-bottom: 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }

    .footer-column {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
        min-width: 180px;
    }

    .footer-brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 18px;
    }

    .footer-column h3 {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .footer-column p {
        color: #e5e7eb;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
        padding-top: 20px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-bottom p {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .footer-bottom p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    h1 {
        color: #111827;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 5px 15px;
        background-color: #e9e9ed;
        color: black;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        transition: background-color 0.25s ease;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    .btn:hover {
        background-color: #dddde2;
    }

    .product-media {
        transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    }

    .product-card:hover .product-media-image {
        transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    .product-card:hover .product-media-empty {
        transform: scale(1.05);
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    {{> navbar}}
    <div class="container">
        {{{body}}}
    </div>
    <footer>
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="footer-column">
                <div class="footer-brand">
                    <img src="/icon.svg" alt="Logo Vertex" style="height: 28px; width: auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 5px; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
                    Vertex
                </div>
                <p>Tu tienda de tecnología: periféricos, monitores, audio, almacenamiento, muebles y accesorios.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-column">
                <h3>Ayuda</h3>
                <a href="#">Contacto</a>
                <a href="#">Dónde encontrarnos</a>
                <a href="#">Política de cambio</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} Vertex. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
            <p>Todas las imágenes de los productos son sólo a modo ilustrativo y pueden diferir del artículo en stock. Los precios indicados tienen IVA incluído y pueden sufrir variaciones sin previo aviso. Disponibilidad sujeta a stock.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>